{"id":"2cf3f8687ad60744","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-elementary-diagram.md","title":"Elementary Diagram","display":"df-elementary-diagram — Elementary Diagram","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elementary-diagram","aliases":["58-df-elementary-diagram","58-df-zfc-model5-elementary-diagram","58-df-zfc-logic9-elementary-diagram","58-df-zfc-model9-elementary-diagram"],"display":"df-elementary-diagram — Elementary Diagram","depends_on":["[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elementary-diagram"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elementary-diagram</span><span>58-df-zfc-model5-elementary-diagram</span><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-elementary-diagram</span><span>58-df-zfc-model9-elementary-diagram</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-diagram — Elementary Diagram"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\">\\(L,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}:V^4\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}:V^4\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryDiagram}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryDiagram}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ElementaryDiagram}_S:V^4\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ElementaryDiagram}_S:V^4\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}canonical} \\vdash \\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}canonical} \\vdash \\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}model5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryDiagram}_S(L,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land D=\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}model5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryDiagram}_S(L,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land D=\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}logic9} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ElementaryDiagram}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}logic9} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ElementaryDiagram}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}model9} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryDiagram}_S(L,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land D=\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}diagram\\text{-}model9} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryDiagram}_S(L,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land D=\\mathrm{Diag}_{\\mathrm{el}}(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The formula-assignment-pair encoding binds the selected satisfaction recursion explicitly; passing to the language with constants for elements is a downstream equivalent presentation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{B} \\supseteq \\mathfrak{A} \\land \\mathfrak{B} \\models \\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\to \\mathfrak{A} \\preceq \\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{B} \\supseteq \\mathfrak{A} \\land \\mathfrak{B} \\models \\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\to \\mathfrak{A} \\preceq \\mathfrak{B}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-model5-elementary-diagram</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-logic9-elementary-diagram</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-model9-elementary-diagram</code> are merged here.</li>\n<li>The chosen four-place satisfaction recursion is an explicit argument of every diagram operator; formulas are paired only with assignments valid for the same structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, with $\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})$ (see [[58-df-satisfaction]])","embed":